 cache will be ignored, which may result in stuttering during gameplay.\n```\n\nDoes event viewer have any logs for Godot that happen near the time of crash?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3998303011/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3998464669","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117000#issuecomment-3998464669","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117000","id":3998464669,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7uU7qd","user":{"login":"Sicklygoose7440","id":197704989,"node_id":"U_kgDOC8i9HQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/197704989?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440","html_url":"https://github.com/Sicklygoose7440","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-04T15:57:34Z","updated_at":"2026-03-04T15:57:34Z","body":"> > It's attached, in the bug report. It's the hyperlink named \"Godot V4.6.1.stable-Windows 11.txt\" That's why I said \"Attached is the verbose debug file th