/users/Sicklygoose7440/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-04T23:53:13Z","updated_at":"2026-03-04T23:53:13Z","body":"> > It's attached, in the bug report. It's the hyperlink named \"Godot V4.6.1.stable-Windows 11.txt\" That's why I said \"Attached is the verbose debug file that I have obtained from a recent crash in 4.6.1 Stable.\"\n> \n> My bad, it was late at night and I missed it. I cannot see anything that would cause a crash in that log. There is something about Vulkan but I do not think that would cause a crash.\n> \n> ```\n> Vulkan 1.4.329 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 SUPER\n> Invalid Vulkan pipelines cache header. This may be due to an engine change, GPU change or graphics driver version change. Existing shader pipeline cache will be ignored, which may result in stuttering during gameplay.\n> ```\n> \n> Does event viewer have any logs for Godot that happen near the time of crash?\n\nSorry I was at work so it took a minute to get the screenshot.\nI found some errors with NVIDIA OpenGL Drivers but that doesn't quite make sense to me because I would imagine that OpenGL is only used in Compatibility  mode, Image below.\n\n<img width=\"1733\" height=\"1068\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/61fd8ed4-da65-4c23-bd08-1d1bc64e8338\" />\n\n.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4001042007/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4001278304","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117000#issuecomment-4001278304","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117000","id":4001278304,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ufqlg","user":{"login":"NateClarkTech","id":129341001,"node_id":"U_kgDOB7WWSQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/129341001?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech","html_url":"https://github.com/NateClarkTech","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NateClarkTech/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-05T00:55:31Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T00:55:31Z","body":"What is the application crashing event in the log or is that unrelated?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4001278304/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4005500921","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117000#issuecomment-4005500921","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117000","id":4005500921,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7uvxf5","user":{"login":"Sicklygoose7440","id":197704989,"node_id":"U_kgDOC8i9HQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/197704989?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440","html_url":"https://github.com/Sicklygoose7440","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-05T14:33:28Z","updated_at":"2026-03-05T14:33:28Z","body":"It's an unrelated crash log for hytale.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4005500921/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4082499767","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117000#issuecomment-4082499767","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117000","id":4082499767,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7zVgC3","user":{"login":"TheYellowArchitect","id":25630803,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NjMwODAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25630803?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheYellowArchitect","html_url":"https://github.com/TheYellowArchitect","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheYellowArchitect/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheYellowArchitect/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheYellowArchitect/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheYellowArchitect/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheYellowArchitect/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheYellowArchitect/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheYellowArchitect/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheYellowArchitect/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheYellowArchitect/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-18T13:16:42Z","updated_at":"2026-03-18T13:24:46Z","body":"I can confirm that Godot silently crashes \"randomly\" but I heavily suspect it's related to GPU overload.\nI use 4.4dev4 daily (it's the most stable version from the 4.0-4.4, and 4.4-4.7 I have used, and also doesn't have the UID refactor), and depending on what I have open on the background, it crashes. \n\n**Before** I did a heavy optimization for my game (GPU Batching), there were 7000 draw calls per frame, and I encountered the following issue: If I ran a browser alongside the editor (e.g. qutebrowser or chromium), the editor sooner or later crashes even if I leave it idle. I remember one time I went afk to eat, and browser and the editor was idle, and on return, I noticed the editor had closed. \nIf there is no browser or GPU-related program on the background, the editor didn't seem to crash. But again, if both were open, there would be a silent crash of the browser or the editor, frequently, most often when I ran the game of course with its 4 new instances (it's an online game). If there is no such crash, and I then open a video (via `mpv` in my case), mpv would display a blue screen for its tile while the audio is correctly playing, so it's a GPU issue.\n\n**After** I did the heavy optimization for my game, I can run a browser and the editor without any crashing deterministically. Instead, if both are open, a silent crash occurs once in a few hours. I can also run the editor and the browser and mpv without issues 99% of the times.\n\nAs for my setup, I use Vulkan/Forward+, Arch Linux, and have a GTX 1050 Ti. I had the above issues even before the recent 480xx drivers split controversy within the arch linux repo.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4082499767/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5339721452","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117000#issuecomment-5339721452","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117000","id":5339721452,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPkWu7A","user":{"login":"caudheur","id":59212435,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MjEyNDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59212435?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur","html_url":"https://github.com/caudheur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T08:47:16Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T08:49:27Z","body":"Same here, I tried all renderer modes, but running my game in the editor always end up crashing with no log. Same as OP, seems very random, I couldn't not connect it to any specific player action or game state. For me it occurs within the range of 1 to 10 minutes. First time it happened was with 4.7, and still crashes with 4.8 dev 3. \nFew precisions: my game is 2D only, simple and light.\n\n<img width=\"799\" height=\"505\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6c227d90-f9fc-4953-9dee-50476aaf4fc1\" />\n\nMy graphics drivers seem to be up to date. Any lead for me to give more exploitable reports is welcomed, I don't even know where to start to investigate better.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5339721452/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5343709048","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117000#issuecomment-5343709048","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117000","id":5343709048,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPoKHeA","user":{"login":"Sicklygoose7440","id":197704989,"node_id":"U_kgDOC8i9HQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/197704989?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440","html_url":"https://github.com/Sicklygoose7440","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T14:40:37Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T14:40:37Z","body":"> Same here, I tried all renderer modes, but running my game in the editor always end up crashing with no log. Same as OP, seems very random, I couldn't not connect it to any specific player action or game state. For me it occurs within the range of 1 to 10 minutes. First time it happened was with 4.7, and still crashes with 4.8 dev 3. Few precisions: my game is 2D only, simple and light.\n\nSo I actually ended up finding a fix for this that ended up working for me but I completely forgot that I made a GitHub post about it 😬. In the settings menu you can set the specific rendering driver packs for each mode and what I ended up having to do was set the render mode for forward + to d3d12 instead of Vulkan (I'm on windows 11 and for some reason my PC doesn't play nice with Vulkan.) This ended up preventing any further crashes on my end and I haven't had it happen since. I left the fallback renderer on Vulkan wich doesn't seem to be causing any issues but any of the modes that relied on Vulkan had to be set to dx12. I think it's something in Nvidia's API or driver packs that isn't playing well with the Vulkan rendering process that's causing godot to freak out like it's not receiving a callback and so it just closes because it doesn't seem to know what to do. I hope this helps.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5343709048/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5344504596","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117000#issuecomment-5344504596","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117000","id":5344504596,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPo6rFA","user":{"login":"caudheur","id":59212435,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MjEyNDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59212435?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur","html_url":"https://github.com/caudheur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T15:45:02Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T15:47:40Z","body":"> So I actually ended up finding a fix for this that ended up working for me but I completely forgot that I made a GitHub post about it 😬. In the settings menu you can set the specific rendering driver packs for each mode and what I ended up having to do was set the render mode for forward + to d3d12 instead of Vulkan (I'm on windows 11 and for some reason my PC doesn't play nice with Vulkan.) This ended up preventing any further crashes on my end and I haven't had it happen since. I left the fallback renderer on Vulkan wich doesn't seem to be causing any issues but any of the modes that relied on Vulkan had to be set to dx12. I think it's something in Nvidia's API or driver packs that isn't playing well with the Vulkan rendering process that's causing godot to freak out like it's not receiving a callback and so it just closes because it doesn't seem to know what to do. I hope this helps.\n\nThank you very much for taking the time to help!\nI tried what you said (see below):\n\n<img width=\"562\" height=\"319\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57c3e6cd-f731-42df-8ffd-920b82579d4a\" />\n\nBut unfortunately I still have the same crashes happening. I still try to reduce my game until I find the culprit, but the lack of output when it crashes really makes things difficult","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5344504596/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5345626634","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117000#issuecomment-5345626634","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117000","id":5345626634,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPp_KCg","user":{"login":"Sicklygoose7440","id":197704989,"node_id":"U_kgDOC8i9HQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/197704989?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440","html_url":"https://github.com/Sicklygoose7440","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sicklygoose7440/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T17:22:28Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T17:22:28Z","body":"> But unfortunately I still have the same crashes happening. I still try to reduce my game until I find the culprit, but the lack of output when it crashes really makes things difficult\n\nYeah the lack of an error is really frustrating. You might try leaving the initial driver on Vulkan and leave fallback on. Here's the way I have mine set up. I'm curious to see if it works for you because if it dies that means this isn't a one off issue. \n\n<img width=\"1190\" height=\"1075\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15ba277b-05ba-4c89-819b-db43ee4b57fd\" />\n\nSorry for the image quality, I had to take a screenshot over steam link as I'm not home rn lol.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5345626634/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5352282433","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117000#issuecomment-5352282433","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117000","id":5352282433,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPwVZQQ","user":{"login":"caudheur","id":59212435,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MjEyNDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59212435?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur","html_url":"https://github.com/caudheur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/caudheur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T06:31:36Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T06:31:36Z","body":"Hey, thank you very much for sticking around and helping, I really appreciate :)\nI applied the same settings as you but unfortunately it still crashes...\nI will try in the coming days to clean my Windows environment, maybe even test on Mac and report if I find anything!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5352282433/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]